-- Rational roots of monic integer cubics are integers, and the two
-- integer cubics behind doubling the cube and trisecting the angle have
-- no integer root: z³ ≠ 2 and z³ ≠ 3z + 1.
-- Part of the Constructible blueprint.
-- Planned home: NumberTheory/CubicIntegerRoots.
